# Upstream ships a prebuilt Go binary built without PIE or full RELRO; the
# recipe repackages it unchanged and cannot relink it.
netbird-ui W: ELF file ('usr/bin/netbird-ui') lacks FULL RELRO, check LDFLAGS.
netbird-ui W: ELF file ('usr/bin/netbird-ui') lacks PIE.
# The app runs xdg-open to send the SSO login to the browser; upstream's .deb
# declares the same dependency.
netbird-ui W: Dependency included, but may not be needed ('xdg-utils')
